window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Desperate. Broken. Unhinged. Vengeful.</p> <p>I’m dead to them.</p> <p>I was buried in a forest, never to be thought of again.</p> <p>Or so I thought.</p> <p>Being stuck in this nightmare, I’m desperate to break free.</p> <p>My whole life seems to be a prison, and with my kings gone, I have a new warden.</p> <p>And this warden is now the kings biggest enemy.</p> <p>If I’ve learned anything from my new life it’s that you can run, but you can’t hide, especially from your past.</p> <p>When the lies and secrets come out, I take matters into my own hands.</p> <p>This queen knows how to rise from the ashes and rule.</p> <p>This time, I’m bringing a few new friends with me and my own brand of revenge.</p> <p>Perfect Little Revenge is book four in the Kings of Bolten series. Please visit author’s website for additional information. This is a dark bully romance with no choosing. Once you meet the kings, you’ll know why. Contains MM.</p>"; 
